Faust 2.85.5: component licenses and additional permissions
========================================================

The compiler is LGPL-2.1-or-later. This package also distributes libraries,
headers, architecture templates, scripts, examples and documentation under
other terms. The package's multiple-license declaration describes these
components together; it does not relicense them or apply every listed
license to every component or to all code generated by Faust.

Original copyright notices and per-file license declarations remain in the
installed files. The excerpts below preserve additional permissions and
notices that the standard license texts alone do not convey. Paths below
refer to the unmodified upstream 2.85.5 source archive.

