-------------
COPYING.txt; compiler/main.cpp: LGPL-2.1-or-later.
compiler/interval/: Apache-2.0.
compiler/parser/faustparser.{cpp,hpp}: GPL-2.0-or-later with Bison exception.
compiler/generator/sha_key.hh: public domain.
