architecture/esp32/drivers/ac101/: GPL-3.0-or-later.
Other Faust architecture files carry GPL-2.0-or-later, GPL-3.0-or-later,
  LGPL-2.1-or-later or LGPL-3.0-or-later, often with the architecture
  exception quoted below. Consult each file's notice.
architecture/max-msp/sndfile/: bundled libsndfile is LGPL-2.1-or-later.
syntax-highlighting/faust.lang: LGPL-2.0-or-later.
libraries/*.lib: LGPL-2.1-or-later with the output exception below, except
  where more specific per-function notices apply, including:
  basics.lib tabulateNd: AGPL-3.0-only.
  compressors.lib ratio2strength and other Bart Brouns functions: GPL-3.0.
  reverbs.lib: GPL-3.0 and GPL-3.0-or-later sections.
  interpolators.lib frdtable/frwtable: LGPL-3.0.
  demos.lib: GPL-2.0-or-later sections.
  vaeffects.lib klonCentaur: BSD-3-Clause.
  filters.lib: ISC, MIT and STK-derived sections.
  quantizers.lib: Unlicense.
  Other individual functions declare MIT or STK-derived terms.
  Some embedded documentation declares CC-BY-4.0, with the upstream
  qualifier preserved below.
examples/: preserve the per-example terms, including GPL-2.0-or-later,
  GPL-3.0, MIT/STK, and a generic BSD declaration in old/freeverb.dsp.

Standard texts absent from the archive were obtained from:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt
